# class: github-issues
# schema: number | state | lifecycle-label | value | complexity | other-labels | title
# source: gh issue list --state all --limit 100 --repo kostiantyn-matsebora/deployment-dashboard
# recipe: builtin:github-issues
# reindexed: 2026-05-25 (initial extract — CR retirement replacement; see CLAUDE.md § CR convention (local))
# refresh-trigger: ginee-reindex sweep · post-acceptance hook on any picked-up issue · explicit @team-lead refresh issue index
# notes:
#   - lifecycle-label = ginee:ready | ginee:in-progress | ginee:blocked | (none)
#   - value / complexity = H | M | L | (none — unscored)
#   - Closed issues retained for cross-reference + back-mapping when a follow-up cites a closed one.
#   - This file replaces docs/cr/* + cr-index.idx — see commit history for the CR text.

